WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.6 · Strategic Foundations
Values in practice

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Values set early shape the culture of everything you build.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Choose three to five and agree them with co-founders.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Write a behaviour, a boundary and evidence for each.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Agree now how you will handle trade-offs.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write three to five values and test them on a hard decision.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
